{"product":{"id":6557870424238,"title":"Norix ATN800-series Attenda Wardrobe","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Attenda Wardrobe keeps everything in its place, yet visible to staff, \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ewith optional door for privacy.  \u003c\/span\u003eThe Attenda Wardrobe is engineered specifically for intensive-use environments, with advanced safety and security features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe wardrobe bolts securely to the wall with 6 connection points.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA molded-in J-channel accommodates clothes hangers with NO tie off opportunity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRounded corners and sloped top for added safety and security.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA 270° continuous piano hinge allows door to fold flat to the side. Factory-installed hinge attaches securely with tamper-resistant hardware (steel-to-steel connections).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify right or left hinge. Or, order wardrobe with no door.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable with wing knob cam latch, or keylock.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes integrated bottom shelf and shoe compartment.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRounded corners and sloped top for added safety and security.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMounting hardware not included).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTwilight, Cove, Sand, Sienna, Dove\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ctable width=\"529\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eModel #\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eOptions\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003eOverall Size\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"64\"\u003eWeight \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eATN800\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eNo Door\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003e26\"W x 24\"D x 78.4\"H \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e75.0 lb\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eATN801-RL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eRight Hinge - Latch\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003e26\"W x 25.25\"D x 78.4\"H \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e80.0 lb\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eATN801-RK\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eRight Hinge - Key Lock\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003e26\"W x 25.25\"D x 78.4\"H \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e80.0 lb\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eATN801-LL\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eLeft Hinge - Latch\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003e26\"W x 25.25\"D x 78.4\"H \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e80.0 lb\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"100\"\u003eATN801-LK\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"184\"\u003eLeft Hinge - Key Lock\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd width=\"181\"\u003e26\"W x 25.25\"D x 78.4\"H \u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e80.0 lb\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\n\u003c\/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Norix Attenda Bedroom Series:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBehavioral healthcare professionals have long recognized that traditional furniture is completely unsuitable for their critical environments. Norix Attenda furniture is designed to provide the strength, safety and cleanability required for the daily rigors of institutional living — in a sleek, contemporary look.  \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSafe, Secure...And Built to Last -- The key to Attenda’s strength and durability is its advanced construction. Molded in specially formulated, high-impact polyethylene, each Norix Attenda product is structurally enhanced for increased strength and durability.  Solid as a rock, yet featuring seamless construction with rounded corners for added safety and security. Each piece is designed to be attached flush to the wall or floor.   Attenda’s rugged, exterior skin is seamless and impervious to liquids, including bodily fluids and industrial cleaners. The non-absorbent, polymer construction simply leaves no place for fluids to go. Chronic maintenance problems are washed away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Norix Furniture:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eNorix Group specializes in providing high quality, intensive-use institutional furniture designed specifically for behavioral health care facilities, hospitals, jails, prisons, detention centers, and other challenging markets. Norix humanizes behavioral and correctional facilities, while building extreme durability and security into each piece of institutional furniture so it stands up to correctional grade use. Norix furniture is as tough as your prison or detention grade environment, yet safe for trustees and staff. Anchortex supplies the complete line of Norix furniture for patient rooms, classrooms, inmate cells, day rooms, lobbies, intake areas, chapels, dining halls, outdoor\/recreation, contact visitation and video-visitation areas, as well as public safety furniture for police and fire stations that looks good and stands up to hard use. Norix meets or exceeds testing requirements for intensive-use institutional and detention grade furniture, and the everyday test of use at healthcare and detention institutions by people who don't necessarily have the best interests of the institutional furniture in mind.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix Furniture","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-03-11T20:35:43-05:00","handle":"norix-attenda-wardrobe","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:41-05:00","published_at":"2021-03-11T23:00:14-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healt